{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip between the cracks of reality into a broken world where danger awaits at every turn. Explore endless dimensions to defy beings born out of pure chaos. Use your hoverboard to fly across gaps of darkness, hack into cyberspace with an alien engineer, and absorb the soul of a dead god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path\u2014and bend this shattered reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Nonlinear Exploration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is nonlinear, offering countless paths to choose from. While the depths of The Backworld include surreal horror, you\u2019ll also explore traditional JRPG-inspired fantasy and sci-fi worlds, including your hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-8d9d0aab674e0c.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival goes beyond combat. Use strategy to overcome challenges\u2014fight when necessary, sneak past threats, or find alternative solutions like diplomacy. Every encounter requires careful thought and can shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-8afb15b01c70f5.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Abilities &amp; Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock turn-based combat abilities as well as action abilities for exploring, like a hoverboard, dodge-roll, and sprinting. Equipping items also grants you further abilities in combat. For example, a knife allows you to apply a bleeding effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/itemz.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recruit Companions &amp; Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a diverse group of companions, including non-human characters, each with their own abilities, personalities, and stories. Each companion has a unique battle resource, like mana for a wizard or energy for a robot, altering how they play in combat. You can also recruit extra pets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-21748d047addc7.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Cosmic Horror Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cosmic war ripples through dimensions, reaching your hometown. With reality crumbling, you and your friends must face The Backworld to stop the chaos before it consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-28e28dd16b9a02.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Many Ways to Play!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explorer:</strong> Focused on story and exploration with a relaxed pace. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventurer:</strong> A balanced RPG experience with elements of horror. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survivor:</strong> A hardcore survival horror mode with perma-death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1871640?t=1740621517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740621517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/675810ec8ef16e83ceabb6b14cc3f31b49b5fdc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740621517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/675810ec8ef16e83ceabb6b14cc3f31b49b5fdc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740621517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are corpses and some blood occasionally. It isn't too crazy. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip between the cracks of reality into a broken world where danger awaits at every turn. Explore endless dimensions to defy beings born out of pure chaos. Use your hoverboard to fly across gaps of darkness, hack into cyberspace with an alien engineer, and absorb the soul of a dead god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path\u2014and bend this shattered reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Nonlinear Exploration</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is nonlinear, offering countless paths to choose from. While the depths of The Backworld include surreal horror, you\u2019ll also explore traditional JRPG-inspired fantasy and sci-fi worlds, including your hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-8d9d0aab674e0c.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival goes beyond combat. Use strategy to overcome challenges\u2014fight when necessary, sneak past threats, or find alternative solutions like diplomacy. Every encounter requires careful thought and can shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871640/extras/ezgif-8afb15b01c70f5.gif?t=1740621517\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Abilities &amp; Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock turn-based combat abilities as well as action abilitie